'--format=[The image format to write\: \`tiff\`, \`png\`, \`jpeg\` or \`dng\` (a linear DNG of a RAW project). Inferred from \`-o\`'\''s extension when omitted (\`.tif\`/\`.tiff\` -> tiff, \`.png\` -> png, \`.jpg\`/\`.jpeg\` -> jpeg, \`.dng\` -> dng, no extension -> tiff, the default); refused if it names a format other than a recognised extension'\''s]:FORMAT:_default' \
'--tiff-bits=[TIFF bit depth\: \`16\` (default) or \`8\`. TIFF only]:BITS:_default' \
'--tiff-compression=[TIFF strip compression\: \`none\` (default), \`lzw\` or \`deflate\`. TIFF only]:NAME:_default' \
'--png-bits=[PNG bit depth\: \`16\` (default) or \`8\`. PNG only]:BITS:_default' \
'--png-compression=[PNG compression effort\: \`fast\`, \`default\` (default) or \`best\`. PNG only]:NAME:_default' \
'--jpeg-quality=[JPEG quality, 1-100, default 95. JPEG only]:N:_default' \
'--jpeg-subsampling=[JPEG chroma subsampling\: \`420\` (default) or \`444\`. JPEG only]:SPEC:_default' \
'--exif=[Carry the alignment reference frame'\''s EXIF\: \`on\` (default) or \`off\`]:EXIF:_default' \
'--icc=[Embed an ICC profile\: \`on\` (default) or \`off\`. Has no effect on a DNG, whose colour is defined by its camera matrices]:ICC:_default' \
'--xmp=[Carry the source frame'\''s XMP packet verbatim\: \`on\` or \`off\` (default)]:XMP:_default' \
'--iptc=[Carry the source frame'\''s IPTC block verbatim\: \`on\` or \`off\` (default). Never written to PNG]:IPTC:_default' \
'--frame=[Write this source frame "as fused" -- warped by its recorded transform and offset by the applied crop, at the resolved checkpoint'\''s own composite width and height. Requires \`--frame-output\`]:INDEX:_default' \
'--frame-output=[Where to write the frame \`--frame\` names]:FILE:_files' \
'--json[Emit the JSON report instead of human-readable text]' \
'*-v[Increase log detail (repeatable)]' \
'-q[Log errors only]' \
'--quiet[Log errors only]' \
'-h[Print help]' \
'--help[Print help]' \
